1
00:00:06,087 --> 00:00:09,147
After Sinbad conquered the dungeon,

2
00:00:09,597 --> 00:00:16,007
many similar structures began to appear all over the world

3
00:00:17,107 --> 00:00:20,807
And many came to challenge said dungeons.

4
00:00:21,027 --> 00:00:25,807
It was the very start of the age of dungeon conquests.

5
00:00:42,327 --> 00:00:43,647
Is this....

6
00:00:45,067 --> 00:00:46,877
a dungeon?

7
00:00:59,557 --> 00:01:01,597
<i>I heard these dungeons were dangerous, but...</i>

8
00:01:10,667 --> 00:01:13,297
<i>They're eating me?</i>

9
00:01:14,437 --> 00:01:15,367
Shit!

10
00:01:23,837 --> 00:01:25,107
This is bad!

11
00:01:25,697 --> 00:01:27,267
Not like this!

12
00:01:27,517 --> 00:01:28,487
In that case...

13
00:01:47,027 --> 00:01:50,577
I'll make sure to get out of here alive.

14
00:02:06,787 --> 00:02:08,097
That door

15
00:02:44,637 --> 00:02:46,527
<i>I'm done running.</i>

16
00:02:46,527 --> 00:02:48,467
<i>I'll become stronger!</i>

17
00:03:08,497 --> 00:03:09,517
Gotcha!

18
00:03:19,857 --> 00:03:21,717
Dead already, huh?

19
00:03:21,967 --> 00:03:24,457
Let me play a bit more, Vitel.

20
00:03:24,747 --> 00:03:26,397
Sorry.

21
00:03:26,837 --> 00:03:28,577
<i>The guy from last night.</i>

22
00:03:33,327 --> 00:03:35,617
Wait. Don't approach it carelessly!

23
00:03:36,157 --> 00:03:38,897
Shut up. Don't you order <i>me</i> around.

24
00:03:40,037 --> 00:03:41,357
What's this?

25
00:03:41,877 --> 00:03:43,817
The key to open that door.

26
00:03:44,907 --> 00:03:48,097
Just ahead lies the treasure room.

27
00:03:49,157 --> 00:03:50,447
Hey, you!

28
00:03:50,977 --> 00:03:52,337
Give that back!

29
00:03:52,837 --> 00:03:55,427
You were with Sinbad, right?

30
00:03:55,967 --> 00:03:57,337
Where is he?

31
00:03:57,637 --> 00:03:58,997
The key mine.

32
00:03:59,247 --> 00:03:59,637
Huh?

33
00:03:59,847 --> 00:04:02,177
Ignore him. Let's get to the treasure room.

34
00:04:02,737 --> 00:04:06,557
Sinbad will come for sure. I'll keep the key safe.

35
00:04:06,557 --> 00:04:08,867
Let's go. Don't bother with this weakling.

36
00:04:11,107 --> 00:04:12,227
Wait!

37
00:04:13,767 --> 00:04:16,597
I told you to wait!

38
00:04:17,117 --> 00:04:17,817
What?

39
00:04:18,037 --> 00:04:19,137
What are you doing?

40
00:04:26,167 --> 00:04:30,877
T-This is the overpowering strength of the far north pillager tribe,

41
00:04:30,877 --> 00:04:33,177
An Imuchakk's power.

42
00:04:34,147 --> 00:04:36,537
The hell's his problem? What a pain in the ass.

43
00:04:36,537 --> 00:04:37,927
Vittel, Mahad.

44
00:04:40,287 --> 00:04:41,917
Go easy on him.

45
00:04:44,657 --> 00:04:47,517
Who are these people? They have powers like this too?

46
00:04:49,947 --> 00:04:52,737
Well, let's get started!

47
00:05:17,567 --> 00:05:18,487
Take this!

48
00:05:22,837 --> 00:05:24,077
This will be

49
00:05:24,727 --> 00:05:26,417
your end!

50
00:05:32,357 --> 00:05:34,147
Balalak Saika.

51
00:05:38,117 --> 00:05:38,917
Shit.

52
00:05:41,347 --> 00:05:42,837
That was a close one, Hina.

53
00:05:43,117 --> 00:05:44,357
Sinbad...

54
00:05:44,957 --> 00:05:45,477
Why?

55
00:05:45,937 --> 00:05:47,557
Look at you getting all the way out here alone.

56
00:05:49,157 --> 00:05:52,337
Long time no see, Sinbad.

57
00:05:52,687 --> 00:05:55,167
Let's see... Who were you again?

58
00:05:55,737 --> 00:05:59,747
I'd never forget a lady's name after seeing her once, but for guys...

59
00:06:00,037 --> 00:06:01,287
You brat...

60
00:06:01,577 --> 00:06:04,357
I see jokes still fly over your head as usual.

61
00:06:05,057 --> 00:06:06,427
I knew we'd meet again

62
00:06:07,277 --> 00:06:07,897
Drakon.

63
00:06:09,757 --> 00:06:14,527
Greetings. I'm a Kou wizard advisor, Falan.

64
00:06:14,527 --> 00:06:17,017
I'll make you feel misery.

65
00:06:18,757 --> 00:06:20,127
Sinbad!

66
00:06:22,407 --> 00:06:24,177
You are my prey!

67
00:06:24,397 --> 00:06:27,777
Wait. This is no time to be killing each other.

68
00:06:28,127 --> 00:06:31,257
Shut up. All I care about is killing you!

69
00:06:32,097 --> 00:06:34,117
You still haven't learned, huh?

70
00:06:34,117 --> 00:06:35,477
Hey, big boy!

71
00:06:35,977 --> 00:06:37,947
We'll take you on.

72
00:06:39,137 --> 00:06:39,857
Hey!

73
00:06:47,387 --> 00:06:48,407
Got you!

74
00:06:54,127 --> 00:06:56,307
Embrace your inner child once in a while, why don't ya?

75
00:06:56,977 --> 00:07:00,067
How? How can you read my attacks?

76
00:07:02,427 --> 00:07:03,537
Just 'cause.

77
00:07:07,367 --> 00:07:08,437
I refuse to

78
00:07:10,697 --> 00:07:11,517
lose to him!

79
00:07:19,497 --> 00:07:20,747
I got you.

80
00:07:21,137 --> 00:07:21,957
This is bad!

81
00:07:22,207 --> 00:07:23,167
Vittel!

82
00:07:23,167 --> 00:07:24,197
Baal!

83
00:07:29,317 --> 00:07:30,777
That would be

84
00:07:30,797 --> 00:07:32,017
a Dungeon item.

85
00:07:33,337 --> 00:07:35,407
This time for sure... You're mine!

86
00:07:48,977 --> 00:07:50,817
How about this?

87
00:07:52,137 --> 00:07:53,777
Thalg Hajar!

88
00:08:07,617 --> 00:08:08,787
The water is freezing?

89
00:08:13,107 --> 00:08:14,747
How unspeakable.

90
00:08:15,217 --> 00:08:19,277
Mustasim's magic research as well as their magicians are advancing.

91
00:08:19,717 --> 00:08:21,787
But I'm not sure if they can use magic like this.

92
00:08:22,537 --> 00:08:24,617
Just who is this wizard?

93
00:08:25,257 --> 00:08:27,157
It seems they managed to escape.

94
00:08:27,627 --> 00:08:31,417
However, you Sham Lash are not as great as I thought.

95
00:08:31,597 --> 00:08:33,027
Huh? What did you say?

96
00:08:33,577 --> 00:08:34,597
Am I wrong?

97
00:08:35,197 --> 00:08:39,527
You can't even catch a boy and a some northerner by yourselves.

98
00:08:40,547 --> 00:08:41,817
Drink this!

99
00:08:41,817 --> 00:08:42,517
Huh?

100
00:08:42,837 --> 00:08:44,027
What's that?

101
00:08:44,447 --> 00:08:46,787
Magic tool made to heal wounds.

102
00:08:47,387 --> 00:08:51,617
We can't let them get any further than us, after all.

103
00:08:57,317 --> 00:08:59,517
My body feels lighter!

104
00:09:02,767 --> 00:09:05,107
So what are we supposed to do now?

105
00:09:05,257 --> 00:09:06,057
Be patient.

106
00:09:06,697 --> 00:09:09,257
There's but one destination for those who enter dungeons.

107
00:09:17,217 --> 00:09:19,117
That ice was amazing!

108
00:09:19,917 --> 00:09:21,957
This time, I was saved by you.

109
00:09:22,727 --> 00:09:23,857
Why did you come here?

110
00:09:24,337 --> 00:09:25,037
Eh?

111
00:09:25,787 --> 00:09:27,577
Why are you here?

112
00:09:28,867 --> 00:09:31,057
It's because of you that I...

113
00:09:31,477 --> 00:09:32,517
Baal!

114
00:09:33,267 --> 00:09:35,387
Lend me your strength!

115
00:09:35,387 --> 00:09:37,587
Crash down, Lightning!

116
00:09:40,147 --> 00:09:43,597
I'll use this dungeon to get stronger!

117
00:09:46,637 --> 00:09:49,017
Just what kind of strength are you looking for?

118
00:09:49,867 --> 00:09:52,507
You're plenty strong.

119
00:10:03,137 --> 00:10:06,057
This is the deepest part of the treasure room.

120
00:10:07,187 --> 00:10:08,877
Well then. Inside we go.

121
00:10:22,347 --> 00:10:23,677
It seems to be this.

122
00:10:24,137 --> 00:10:26,947
Lord Dragl. Call the Djinn.

123
00:10:26,947 --> 00:10:27,767
Yeah.

124
00:10:39,177 --> 00:10:42,487
I am Valefor.

125
00:10:43,107 --> 00:10:45,687
Who will be the king?

126
00:10:46,487 --> 00:10:48,947
So he's this dungeon's Djinn.

127
00:10:48,947 --> 00:10:50,187
It smells.

128
00:10:51,377 --> 00:10:55,817
You. I know you're in a fake body.

129
00:10:56,277 --> 00:11:01,447
It's just like the vile smell of that world's flower.

130
00:11:01,917 --> 00:11:03,077
H-Hey!

131
00:11:03,757 --> 00:11:05,057
Begone!

132
00:11:10,297 --> 00:11:12,187
Falan turned into a doll?

133
00:11:13,497 --> 00:11:14,427
What's wrong?

134
00:11:14,847 --> 00:11:17,177
It seems the Djinn has a very sharp nose.

135
00:11:18,097 --> 00:11:21,357
However, I have left them a  fun souvenir.

136
00:11:22,147 --> 00:11:23,547
Lord Barbarossa.

137
00:11:26,397 --> 00:11:29,907
Well, now it's just a matter of who will be the king.

138
00:11:29,907 --> 00:11:33,167
It's me. I'll make a contract with you.

139
00:11:33,537 --> 00:11:36,787
What will you do with the power of a king?

140
00:11:37,077 --> 00:11:39,377
Naturally, I will take it back to Partevia

141
00:11:39,377 --> 00:11:41,437
and use it to serve my king.

142
00:11:43,997 --> 00:11:47,677
Eh? Seriously?

143
00:11:48,027 --> 00:11:50,687
I'm kind of disappointed.

144
00:11:50,687 --> 00:11:53,887
I put effort into it and everything.

145
00:11:53,887 --> 00:11:59,407
What I asked is what you want to do with this power for yourself.

146
00:11:59,407 --> 00:12:02,337
But with your answer, you're not fit to be a king.

147
00:12:06,367 --> 00:12:08,017
We caught up to you, Drakon.

148
00:12:09,127 --> 00:12:10,397
Sinbad.

149
00:12:10,637 --> 00:12:16,097
Okay. Seems like all the survivors are gathered here now.

150
00:12:17,347 --> 00:12:22,027
The one of you six to pass my test will be king.

151
00:12:22,027 --> 00:12:23,987
The power of the king is almighty.

152
00:12:23,987 --> 00:12:30,307
Power to destroy a country overnight, or the wealth to build one!

153
00:12:30,307 --> 00:12:33,437
Well, who wants to become king?

154
00:12:35,747 --> 00:12:39,547
With this power, one could mess around for the rest of their life.

155
00:12:39,957 --> 00:12:41,917
By one of six, you mean I'm in this too?

156
00:12:42,297 --> 00:12:43,677
Of course.

157
00:12:43,677 --> 00:12:48,067
Everyone here has a chance, including you.

158
00:12:48,497 --> 00:12:49,637
What does this mean?

159
00:12:49,857 --> 00:12:53,837
I mean if you overcome this test you might find what you really want

160
00:12:53,837 --> 00:12:57,197
and become molded into a king for all you know.

161
00:12:57,197 --> 00:12:58,657
<i>Is that supposed to make me happy?</i>

162
00:12:59,427 --> 00:13:01,477
However, this is my last chance.

163
00:13:02,367 --> 00:13:05,727
Yo, thug, we'll be taking part of this for ourselves.

164
00:13:06,197 --> 00:13:09,057
Escaping the organization never came across my mind

165
00:13:09,497 --> 00:13:11,237
It's different if I have power.

166
00:13:13,377 --> 00:13:15,727
Sounds good. I'll kill you all together.

167
00:13:15,727 --> 00:13:18,987
It's a blood festival for everyone here!

168
00:13:19,377 --> 00:13:21,477
I'm here to become stronger.

169
00:13:21,977 --> 00:13:24,677
To become a powerful warrior renowned by everyone.

170
00:13:25,177 --> 00:13:27,237
This time, with my own power.

171
00:13:27,977 --> 00:13:29,257
Okay. I'll join too.

172
00:13:30,047 --> 00:13:33,857
Si-Sinbad, you've already got--

173
00:13:33,857 --> 00:13:36,547
You already have Baal, but you want me too?

174
00:13:36,547 --> 00:13:37,997
How greedy.

175
00:13:38,277 --> 00:13:39,967
Yes you're right.

176
00:13:41,387 --> 00:13:42,477
I won't let you have it.

177
00:13:44,237 --> 00:13:47,897
The power is mine, I won't let anyone else take it!

178
00:13:51,127 --> 00:13:52,647
Same here.

179
00:13:53,687 --> 00:13:58,357
This is good. Everyone has ambition filled eyes.

180
00:13:59,697 --> 00:14:03,407
This will be you lot's final oponent.

181
00:14:03,407 --> 00:14:07,707
A part of my soul, Minifor.

182
00:14:10,617 --> 00:14:14,057
The final test is to catch this little one here.

183
00:14:14,537 --> 00:14:15,977
Exactly what do you mean?

184
00:14:16,157 --> 00:14:21,917
As I said, who first catches him will get the power of the king.

185
00:14:22,417 --> 00:14:23,357
What?!

186
00:14:24,607 --> 00:14:30,297
However, if no one can catch him before the last drop of this water clock,

187
00:14:30,297 --> 00:14:33,827
You won't be able to leave the dungeon.

188
00:14:33,827 --> 00:14:35,837
Very well. Let's begin.

189
00:14:37,897 --> 00:14:40,937
Easy. This is all I have to do!

190
00:14:44,387 --> 00:14:46,707
Well then, will he be caught?

191
00:14:54,527 --> 00:14:56,317
He's mine!

192
00:14:56,687 --> 00:14:59,227
Sorry, my aim seems to be off.

193
00:14:59,877 --> 00:15:03,107
If it's come to that, I have an idea too.

194
00:15:03,107 --> 00:15:05,377
Oh? And just what is that?

195
00:15:05,377 --> 00:15:10,907
Good, keep going, mankind will never change.

196
00:15:10,907 --> 00:15:11,707
Wait a minute.

197
00:15:11,707 --> 00:15:12,377
Huh?

198
00:15:13,077 --> 00:15:14,417
You guys need to calm down.

199
00:15:15,057 --> 00:15:17,597
There's only one way to survive and that's to cooperate.

200
00:15:18,377 --> 00:15:21,417
Screw that. Only one person can become king!

201
00:15:21,417 --> 00:15:23,077
You think we're gonna work with each other?

202
00:15:23,697 --> 00:15:26,267
And what if this is what Valefor wants?

203
00:15:27,717 --> 00:15:29,397
It's hard to catch by yourself.

204
00:15:29,957 --> 00:15:32,307
But, if we work together I'm sure we can do it.

205
00:15:32,657 --> 00:15:34,817
But how do we actually catch him?

206
00:15:35,397 --> 00:15:36,707
We surround Minifor

207
00:15:37,277 --> 00:15:38,777
then jump at the same time.

208
00:15:39,697 --> 00:15:41,457
After that we can just run after him.

209
00:15:42,137 --> 00:15:44,517
If someone does catch him, no regrets.

210
00:15:44,957 --> 00:15:47,077
Who will give the signal to start running?

211
00:15:47,677 --> 00:15:49,917
The person giving the signal will have a huge disadvantage!

212
00:15:51,717 --> 00:15:53,287
Then I will give the command.

213
00:15:53,757 --> 00:15:54,617
What did you say?

214
00:15:54,927 --> 00:15:55,817
Damn you.

215
00:15:55,817 --> 00:15:57,587
That's why I won't join.

216
00:15:58,677 --> 00:16:01,437
I have nothing to hold the feline djinn.

217
00:16:02,137 --> 00:16:03,557
I already have one anyway.

218
00:16:04,597 --> 00:16:07,497
Moreover, getting out of here alive is more important.

219
00:16:13,917 --> 00:16:18,197
Do not rush! Note the distance between you and move in slowly!

220
00:16:18,707 --> 00:16:20,647
We only have one chance!

221
00:16:22,337 --> 00:16:24,107
<i>I can't believe I'm following his plans.</i>

222
00:16:24,677 --> 00:16:27,207
<i>But we have no other choice.</i>

223
00:16:27,637 --> 00:16:29,647
Hina, don't leave openings!

224
00:16:30,067 --> 00:16:32,627
Something... Something's off.

225
00:16:38,597 --> 00:16:40,457
I won't let anyone else have it!

226
00:16:41,897 --> 00:16:43,367
I'll get it!

227
00:16:43,367 --> 00:16:44,907
The power of a king.

228
00:16:45,697 --> 00:16:48,067
He can't possibly have given up.

229
00:16:48,587 --> 00:16:50,827
Is there really nothing more to this?

230
00:16:51,247 --> 00:16:53,477
If so, I'll take it for myself!

231
00:16:54,127 --> 00:16:54,847
Now!

232
00:17:07,547 --> 00:17:08,497
It jumped?

233
00:17:17,237 --> 00:17:18,967
Got ya!

234
00:17:19,997 --> 00:17:21,767
My gut feeling was right!

235
00:17:22,237 --> 00:17:23,437
Sinbad...

236
00:17:23,697 --> 00:17:25,117
You tricked us!

237
00:17:25,517 --> 00:17:28,227
You usurped me again!

238
00:17:29,797 --> 00:17:32,317
I knew I should have killed you!

239
00:17:32,657 --> 00:17:34,057
Is that so?

240
00:17:38,817 --> 00:17:42,077
If I didn't do that, we would have never left the dungeon.

241
00:17:43,687 --> 00:17:49,357
Or if I'd not told you to cooperate, we would never have left the dungeon.

242
00:17:50,377 --> 00:17:53,857
Therefore, it is not about who is right or wrong.

243
00:17:54,377 --> 00:17:57,377
But who should get the power of the king.

244
00:17:57,817 --> 00:18:00,417
That's obviously me.

245
00:18:01,057 --> 00:18:01,967
Why you ask?

246
00:18:02,447 --> 00:18:06,357
I want this Djinn the most.

247
00:18:11,227 --> 00:18:12,617
Can't sleep?

248
00:18:13,837 --> 00:18:15,977
This is the path that Hina chose.

249
00:18:18,037 --> 00:18:20,597
All we can do now is rely on Sinbad.

250
00:18:21,767 --> 00:18:22,577
I ...

251
00:18:23,117 --> 00:18:23,957
Will not die.

252
00:18:25,467 --> 00:18:26,257
Yeah.

253
00:18:26,737 --> 00:18:28,457
He had the most frightening eyes.

254
00:18:30,317 --> 00:18:31,137
But ...

255
00:18:32,097 --> 00:18:35,397
What would you use this power for?

256
00:18:36,527 --> 00:18:38,267
To gain untold riches?

257
00:18:38,617 --> 00:18:41,177
In order to have power beyond reason?

258
00:18:41,627 --> 00:18:43,267
To conquer other countries?

259
00:18:44,277 --> 00:18:45,887
If it were me, I'd use this power

260
00:18:46,757 --> 00:18:48,517
To create a country that will change the world.

261
00:18:49,297 --> 00:18:50,947
A country that can

262
00:18:50,947 --> 00:18:52,237
change the world?

263
00:18:52,757 --> 00:18:55,717
I've been thinking ever since I left Partevia,

264
00:18:56,497 --> 00:18:58,797
as well as when I came here to Imuchakk.

265
00:18:59,097 --> 00:19:01,017
I finally figured out what I should aim for

266
00:19:02,547 --> 00:19:06,047
I want to unite the people and countries

267
00:19:06,657 --> 00:19:09,337
and create a world where people go forward hand in hand.

268
00:19:10,157 --> 00:19:15,397
That's why I want to create a country that joins the world together!

269
00:19:16,277 --> 00:19:19,497
The world and present times are not that simple.

270
00:19:20,217 --> 00:19:23,997
What you say can only exist in dreams!

271
00:19:25,737 --> 00:19:27,727
That's why I'm doing it.

272
00:19:29,437 --> 00:19:36,607
I, the young man who first conquered the first dungeon in history, Sinbad,

273
00:19:37,297 --> 00:19:40,477
will establish a new nation to change the world!

274
00:19:40,847 --> 00:19:41,717
What do you think?

275
00:19:41,977 --> 00:19:43,757
Pretty exciting, eh?

276
00:19:44,597 --> 00:19:48,957
I will definitely make it happen.

277
00:19:56,527 --> 00:19:57,947
For some reason...

278
00:20:00,157 --> 00:20:03,577
Sinbad's words are making me feel hot

279
00:20:07,097 --> 00:20:12,667
His eyes were powerful and just pulled me in.

280
00:20:20,847 --> 00:20:24,317
That's why I want you all to come with me, to create this new nation.

281
00:20:26,107 --> 00:20:29,287
<i>I want to follow him.</i>

282
00:20:30,457 --> 00:20:32,917
I need friends to help me.

283
00:20:33,167 --> 00:20:39,287
Experts in business, clever diplomacy, smart information gathering, as well as...

284
00:20:40,397 --> 00:20:44,547
those who can come along with my adventures through the world.

285
00:20:46,387 --> 00:20:49,047
So this is a man fit to be king?

286
00:20:49,997 --> 00:20:52,727
My dream is still far from being a reality.

287
00:20:53,077 --> 00:20:59,067
Strength, friends, even myself. I want it all!

288
00:21:00,457 --> 00:21:03,217
Therefore, I want you to join me by by side!

289
00:21:05,777 --> 00:21:09,577
Hey, are you sure you want to be our allies?

290
00:21:11,247 --> 00:21:14,677
Of course, I want to be allies with everyone here.

291
00:21:16,287 --> 00:21:21,407
Looks like he'll accept people like us, eh, Mahad?

292
00:21:24,047 --> 00:21:27,447
Excellent! I will also be your ally.

293
00:21:27,447 --> 00:21:28,397
Thug?

294
00:21:28,397 --> 00:21:31,177
Lately I've been bored in the organization.

295
00:21:32,717 --> 00:21:34,267
Looking forward to working with you.

296
00:21:36,417 --> 00:21:37,357
Yeah.

297
00:21:43,427 --> 00:21:44,327
Stupid!

298
00:21:44,327 --> 00:21:48,527
You think someone like <i>me</i> will be subordinated by you?

299
00:21:49,517 --> 00:21:50,387
No.

300
00:21:52,277 --> 00:21:54,577
I'll make you my ally!

301
00:22:05,177 --> 00:22:06,497
What is this?

302
00:22:11,337 --> 00:22:15,397
My body feels like it's burning. Who's inside me?

303
00:22:21,157 --> 00:22:22,397
What's going on?

304
00:22:26,057 --> 00:22:27,847
It has begun.

305
00:22:35,417 --> 00:22:38,297
How dare you do this in my dungeon!

306
00:22:38,707 --> 00:22:41,187
At this rate this monster will finish forming.

307
00:22:41,187 --> 00:22:44,397
Blast that thing with Baal's power!

308
00:22:45,537 --> 00:22:48,177
You're still a boy!

309
00:22:48,717 --> 00:22:50,337
You don't understand.

310
00:22:51,707 --> 00:22:53,217
Sinbad?

311
00:22:57,097 --> 00:22:58,597
Wa-What are you doing?

312
00:23:00,477 --> 00:23:02,497
I will not let any of my comrades be killed!

